/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 112 0 R
/E (TTS \(Text-to-Speech\) is a technology that converts written text into spoken human-like audio. For example, if the smart home system generates the text "The lights have been turned on," the TTS system converts this text into speech that can be played through a speaker.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
